tldr (FULL_VERSION) stable; urgency=low

  ## v1.13.1 (2026-05-22)

  - Updated rustls-webpki to fix vulnerabilities.
    ([#172](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/172))
  - Fix too many spaces in `--info` output.
  - Binaries for aarch64 systems are now available on GitHub releases.
    ([#173](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/173))

  ## v1.13.0 (2026-03-31)

  - New command-line option `--edit` and config option `output.edit_link`,
    which print a link to edit the shown page in the GitHub web editor.
  - New command-line option `-s`, `--search`.
    ([#160](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/160))

  ## v1.12.0 (2025-09-30)

  - New config option `cache.defer_auto_update` to perform automatic updates
    after the page is shown. ([#125](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/125))
  - Verbose mode (`--verbose`).
  - Fix panic on `--config-path` when `TLRC_CONFIG` is set to an invalid value.
  - Don't print colors if stderr is not a terminal.
  - `--clean-cache` is now interactive: choose which directories to delete.

  ## v1.11.1 (2025-05-05)

  - Increase the HTTP request timeout to 30 seconds.
    ([#128](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/128))
  - Fix issues with proxies.

  ## v1.11.0 (2025-03-16)

  - Fix loading TLS certificates from the OS store.
    ([#111](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/111))
  - New config option `output.line_length` (default 0 = terminal width).
    ([#120](https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/pull/120))
  - Client specification v2.3: new `--short-options` and `--long-options`
    command-line options and the `output.option_style` config option.

  Older entries have been trimmed. The complete upstream changelog lives at
  https://github.com/tldr-pages/tlrc/releases
